<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings down in week to Jan 21.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings down in week to Jan 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jan 22 (reuter) - Brent blend loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal fell to 589,887 tonnes in the week to January 21 from 819,555 tonnes the previous week, Shetland islands Marine Operations said.</p>
